<title>PHILIPPINES: SPI 1996 net income rises slightly.</title>
<headline>SPI 1996 net income rises slightly.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>				  (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Revenues			  314.788 vs 233.4</p>
<p>    Net income			 50.309 vs 41.299</p>
<p>Note: Full name SPI Technologies Inc. The data processing firm said its earnings per share as of end-1996 is at 84 centavos.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 632 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
